# Git LFS for design media.
#
# Without this, a 40 MB hero video is stored in git history forever and every
# clone downloads every version of it ever committed. LFS keeps a small pointer
# in the repo and the bytes outside it, so the repo stays fast.
#
# INSTALL.md installs `git lfs`. If it is NOT installed, these files are still
# committed correctly as ordinary files — you just lose the size benefit — so a
# missing LFS never breaks a deploy.
#
# Managed by Loop. If you add a media type the deploy step accepts, add it here
# too. SVG and other text formats are deliberately absent: they diff usefully.

design/assets/**/*.png  filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
design/assets/**/*.jpg  filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
design/assets/**/*.jpeg filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
design/assets/**/*.gif  filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
design/assets/**/*.webp filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
design/assets/**/*.avif filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
design/assets/**/*.ico  filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
design/assets/**/*.mp4  filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
design/assets/**/*.webm filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
design/assets/**/*.mov  filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
design/assets/**/*.mp3  filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
design/assets/**/*.wav  filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
design/assets/**/*.pdf  filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
design/assets/**/*.woff2 filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
